  "details": "Repro steps:\n1. Add an arbitrary node.\n2. Push \"Reload Graph\". Then the node moves.\nIf you select the node before pushing \"Reload Graph\", the node doesn't move.\nAfter the node moves, the position (x,y) value is always (0, 0) that is shown in the Inspector. So, I guess some model-view unsynchronization has happened when just after adding node.\n\nTested with: VRCSDK3+UDON-2020.04.01.10.20",
